# __NAME__

On the stack: mise for tasks and tools, fnox for secrets, hk for checks,
packslip for releases, `dev` for every stage of every command.

```
mise install      # every tool, the git hooks, the pinned Claude Code skills
mise run test     # what CI runs
mise run dev      # cmd/__NAME__ on http://127.0.0.1:8080
mise tasks        # everything else
```
